      <article class="about-editorial-content">
        <h1>
          Medeacup is a creative intelligence company built around one idea:
          find what changes the economics.
        </h1>
        <p>
          We work where strategy, creativity, experience design and commercial
          execution meet. The problem might be a buyer nobody has properly
          understood. A position the market has not claimed. A message that does
          not move consideration. A growth system that is leaking value. Or an
          experience that is failing to create preference: before the choice,
          during it, and long after it. We find the leverage point, develop the
          response and stay close to the outcome.
        </p>

        <section>
          <h2>Why Medeacup</h2>
          <em>The work has always come before the credentials.</em>
          <p>
            In 2019, an unknown diaper brand in Dubai needed customers before it
            had a real market presence. We did not start with ads. We started
            with free trials in Facebook mother groups. 400 leads. 60%
            conversion. The product sold before the brand existed.
          </p>
          <p>
            Later, a US sneaker brand had crossed $1M in sales but could not
            clearly identify its buyer. Understanding the buyer moved monitored
            sales from $500 to $3,000 a month in 40 days.
          </p>
          <p>
            The lesson was consistent: find what actually matters, then build
            around it.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>How we work</h2>
          <em
            >Close to the problem. Close to the team. Accountable to outcomes.</em
          >
          <p>
            The people thinking about the problem stay close to the people
            solving it. Strategy, creativity and execution are connected rather
            than passed through disconnected layers. <b
              >We are as focused on what happens after the choice as on what
